@startuml 007-structure-seq-tree
title Admin/Manager View Structure Tree Sequence

actor User
participant "StructureTreeController" as Ctrl
participant "StructureTreeService" as Svc
database "Database" as DB

User -> Ctrl: GET /api/v1/properties/{propertyId}/structure
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> Ctrl: @PropertyAccessValidator(propertyId)
note left of Ctrl: If Manager: checks assignment\nIf Admin: allows all

Ctrl -> Svc: getTree(propertyId)
activate Svc

Svc -> DB: fetchFloorsAndRooms(propertyId)
note right of DB: SELECT f.*, r.* FROM floors f\nLEFT JOIN rooms r ON f.id = r.floor_id\nWHERE f.property_id = ?\nORDER BY f.floor_number, r.room_number
activate DB
DB --> Svc: Flat ResultSet
deactivate DB

Svc -> Svc: group by Floor
Svc -> Svc: map to StructureTreeResponse
note right of Svc: { propertyId,\n  floors: [ {\n    floorNumber,\n    rooms: [ ... ]\n  } ]\n}

Svc --> Ctrl: StructureTreeResponse
deactivate Svc

Ctrl --> User: 200 OK
deactivate Ctrl
@enduml
